{"source":"torrey","letter":"k","topics":[{"slug":"kenites-the","name":"Kenites, The","source":"torrey","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"index":1,"text":"Originally a people of Canaan — Ge 15:19.","refs":["Ge 15:19"]},{"index":2,"text":"Connected with the Midianites — Nu 10:29; Jdj 4:11.","refs":["Nu 10:29","Jdj 4:11"]},{"index":3,"text":"Dwelt in strongholds — Nu 24:21.","refs":["Nu 24:21"]},{"index":4,"text":"Had many cities — 1Sa 30:29.","refs":["1Sa 30:29"]},{"index":5,"text":"Moses","refs":[]},{"index":6,"text":"Intermarried with. — Ex 2:21; Jdj 1:16.","refs":["Ex 2:21","Jdj 1:16"]},{"index":7,"text":"Invited, to accompany Israel. — Nu 10:29-32.","refs":["Nu 10:29-32"]},{"index":8,"text":"Part of, dwelt with Israel — Jdj 1:16; 4:11.","refs":["Jdj 1:16; 4:11"]},{"index":9,"text":"Part of, dwelt with the Amalekites — 1Sa 15:6.","refs":["1Sa 15:6"]},{"index":10,"text":"Showed kindness to Israel in the desert — Ex 18:1-27.","refs":["Ex 18:1-27"]},{"index":11,"text":"Not destroyed with the Amalekites — 1Sa 15:6.","refs":["1Sa 15:6"]},{"index":12,"text":"The Rechabites descended from — 1Ch 2:55.","refs":["1Ch 2:55"]},{"index":13,"text":"Sisera slain by Jael one of — Jdj 4:22; 5:24.","refs":["Jdj 4:22; 5:24"]},{"index":14,"text":"David","refs":[]},{"index":15,"text":"Pretended that he invaded. — 1Sa 27:10.","refs":["1Sa 27:10"]},{"index":16,"text":"Sent part of the spoil of war to. — 1Sa 30:29.","refs":["1Sa 30:29"]},{"index":17,"text":"Ruin of, predicted — Nu 24:21,22.","refs":["Nu 24:21,22"]}]},{"slug":"kings","name":"Kings","source":"torrey","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"index":1,"text":"Israel warned against seeking — 1Sa 8:9-18.","refs":["1Sa 8:9-18"]},{"index":2,"text":"Sin of Israel in seeking — 1Sa 12:17-20.","refs":["1Sa 12:17-20"]},{"index":3,"text":"Israel in seeking, rejected God as their king — 1Sa 8:7; 10:19.","refs":["1Sa 8:7; 10:19"]},{"index":4,"text":"Israel asked for, that they might be like the nations — 1Sa 8:5,19,20.","refs":["1Sa 8:5,19,20"]},{"index":5,"t