 Da 2:21.","refs":["1Ki 11:11","Da 2:21"]},{"index":133,"text":"Christ is the Prince of — Re 1:5.","refs":["Re 1:5"]},{"index":134,"text":"Christ is the King of — Re 17:14.","refs":["Re 17:14"]},{"index":135,"text":"Reign by direction of Christ — Pr 8:15.","refs":["Pr 8:15"]},{"index":136,"text":"Supreme judges of nations — 1Sa 8:5.","refs":["1Sa 8:5"]},{"index":137,"text":"Resistance to, is resistance to the ordinance of God — Ro 13:2.","refs":["Ro 13:2"]},{"index":138,"text":"Able to enforce their commands — Ec 8:4.","refs":["Ec 8:4"]},{"index":139,"text":"Numerous subjects the honour of — Pr 14:28.","refs":["Pr 14:28"]},{"index":140,"text":"Not save by their armies — Ps 33:16.","refs":["Ps 33:16"]},{"index":141,"text":"Dependent on the earth — Ec 5:9.","refs":["Ec 5:9"]},{"index":142,"text":"Should","refs":[]},{"index":143,"text":"Fear God. — De 17:19.","refs":["De 17:19"]},{"index":144,"text":"Serve Christ. — Ps 2:10-12.","refs":["Ps 2:10-12"]},{"index":145,"text":"Keep the law of God. — 1Ki 2:3.","refs":["1Ki 2:3"]},{"index":146,"text":"Study the Scriptures. — De 17:19.","refs":["De 17:19"]},{"index":147,"text":"Promote the interests of the Church. — Ezr 1:2-4; 6:1-12.","refs":["Ezr 1:2-4; 6:1-12"]},{"index":148,"text":"Nourish the Church. — Isa 49:23.","refs":["Isa 49:23"]},{"index":149,"text":"Rule in the fear of God. — 2Sa 23:3.","refs":["2Sa 23:3"]},{"index":150,"text":"Maintain the cause of the poor and oppressed. — Pr 31:8,9.","refs":["Pr 31:8,9"]},{"index":151,"text":"Investigate all matters. — Pr 25:2.","refs":["Pr 25:2"]},{"index":152,"text":"Not pervert judgment. — Pr 31:5.","refs":["Pr 31:5"]},{"index":153,"text":"Prolong their reign by hating covetousness — Pr 28:16.","refs":["Pr 28:16"]},{"index":154,"text":"Throne of, established by righteousness and justice — Pr 16:12; 29:14.","refs":["Pr 16:12; 29:14"]},{"index":155,"text":"Specially warned against","refs":[]},{"index":156,"text":"Impurity. — Pr 31:3.","refs":["Pr 31:3"]},{"index":157,"text":"Lying. — Pr 17:7.","refs":["Pr 17:7"]},{"index":158,"text":"Hearkening to lies. — Pr 29:12.","refs":["Pr 29:12"]},{"index":159,"text":"Intemperance. — Pr 31:4,5.","refs":["Pr 31:4,5"]},{"index":160,"text":"The gospel to be preached to — Ac 9:15; 26:27,28.","refs":["Ac 9:15; 26:27,28"]},{"index":161,"text":"Without understanding, are oppressors — Pr 28:16.","refs":["Pr 28:16"]},{"index":162,"text":"Often reproved by God — 1Ch 16:21.","refs":["1Ch 16:21"]},{"index":163,"text":"Judgments upon, when opposed to Christ — Ps 2:2,5,9.","refs":["Ps 2:2,5,9"]},{"index":164,"text":"When good","refs":[]},{"index":165,"text":"Regard God as their strength. — Ps 99:4.","refs":["Ps 99:4"]},{"index":166,"text":"Speak righteously. — Pr 16:10.","refs":["Pr 16:10"]},{"index":167,"text":"Love righteous lips. — Pr 16:13.","refs":["Pr 16:13"]},{"index":168,"text":"Abhor wickedness. — Pr 16:12.","refs":["Pr 16:12"]},{"index":169,"text":"Discountenance evil. — Pr 20:8.","refs":["Pr 20:8"]},{"index":170,"text":"Punish the wicked. — Pr 20:8.","refs":["Pr 20:8"]},{"index":171,"text":"Favour the wise. — Pr 14:35.","refs":["Pr 14:35"]},{"index":172,"text":"Honour the diligent. — Pr 22:29.","refs":["Pr 22:29"]},{"index":173,"text":"Befriend the good. — Pr 22:14.","refs":["Pr 22:14"]},{"index":174,"text":"Are pacified by submission. — Pr 16:14; 25:15.","refs":["Pr 16:14; 25:15"]},{"index":175,"text":"Evil counsellors should be removed from — 2Ch 22:3,4; Pr 25:5.","refs":["2Ch 22:3,4","Pr 25:5"]},{"index":176,"text":"Curse not, even in thought — Ex 22:28; Ec 10:20.","refs":["Ex 22:28","Ec 10:20"]},{"index":177,"text":"Speak no evil of — Job 34:18; 2Pe 2:10.","refs":["Job 34:18","2Pe 2:10"]},{"index":178,"text":"Pay tribute to — Mt 22:21; Ro 13:6,7.","refs":["Mt 22:21","Ro 13:6,7"]},{"index":179,"text":"Be not presumptuous before — Pr 25:6.","refs":["Pr 25:6"]},{"index":180,"text":"Should be","refs":[]},{"index":181,"text":"Honoured. — Ro 13:7; 1Pe 2:17.","refs":["Ro 13:7","1Pe 2:17"]},{"index":182,"t